    "续页": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kinlogue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "续页不会覆盖无法识别的内容。请保留原目录，或从数据备份恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kinlogue will not overwrite unrecognized content. Keep the original folder, or restore from a data backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "续页只在这台 Mac 上处理和保存资料，不会发送到云端或外部服务。只有在你主动开启“手机上传”时，才会临时接收同一局域网内浏览器发送的资料。当前版本不提供应用层加密：报告和医学影像原件、成员资料及 OCR 结果以可读取的本地文件保存。能够访问此 Mac 用户资料的人员或软件，以及包含资料库的 Time Machine 备份、APFS 快照或其他副本，可能读取这些内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kinlogue processes and stores data only on this Mac and does not send it to cloud or external services. It temporarily accepts browser uploads on the same local network only when you explicitly start Phone Uploads. This version does not provide application-level encryption: report and medical imaging originals, family member data, and OCR results are stored as readable local files. People or software with access to this Mac user's data, as well as Time Machine backups, APFS snapshots, or other copies containing the library, may be able to read them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "待确认（%lld）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Awaiting Review (%lld)"
