    "你的问题：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your question: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这不是匿名化：报告转录里可能印有姓名、病历号等信息，会原样发送。内容发送后无法撤回；对方保存多久取决于你的 Codex 账号设置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is not anonymization: names, record numbers and similar details printed in the reports are sent as transcribed. What is sent cannot be withdrawn; how long it is kept depends on your Codex account settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送给 Codex 前请确认": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Confirm Before Sending to Codex"
          }
        }
