            "state": "translated",
            "value": "History"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有没有关联记录或草稿时才能删除；否则请先重分配或逐条删除关联内容。这位成员保存的 AI 对话会一并删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A family member can be deleted only when no records or drafts are linked. Reassign or delete linked items first. This member's saved AI chats are deleted with it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对话会从本机资料库中删除；已写入的备份仍包含它，已发送给 Codex 服务的内容也不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The chat is deleted from the library on this Mac. Backups already written still contain it, and what was sent to the Codex service is not affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对话保存在本机资料库中，可在“历史对话”里删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chats are saved in the library on this Mac and can be deleted under History."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对话和报告一样以明文保存在本机资料库中，也包含在不加密的备份压缩包里；删除成员时一并删除。关闭 AI 对话不会删除它们。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Like reports, chats are saved unencrypted in the library on this Mac and included in the unencrypted backup archives. They are deleted with their member. Turning off AI chat does not delete them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
