      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update with Current Rules"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下面的字段由当前的识别规则从这份报告保存的识别结果重新整理，没有重新识别原件。勾选的字段换成新规则的结果，没有勾选的保持不变。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These fields were read again by the current recognition rules from the recognition results saved with this report; the original was not recognized again. Ticked fields take the new reading, and the rest stay as they are."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存后这份报告不再提示，之后仍可以随时编辑。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
