    "原始文件按家庭成员和日期排列，解压后可以直接打开或打印。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Original files are arranged by family member and date and open or print directly once unzipped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "另一项资料库操作正在进行，请稍后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another library operation is in progress. Try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份不完整或已损坏，当前资料库没有变化。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The backup is incomplete or damaged. The current library was not changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份到文件夹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back Up to a Folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份可能已经写入，但无法确认磁盘同步状态。请检查备份文件夹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The backup may have been written, but whether it reached the disk could not be confirmed. Check the backup folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份在网盘里时，请先确认它已完整下载到这台 Mac。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the backup is in a cloud drive, make sure it has fully downloaded to this Mac first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份已导出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup Exported"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份文件不加密，包含全部健康资料": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup files are not encrypted and contain all health information"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份文件不加密，包含全部健康资料。放在网盘同步文件夹里，网盘服务商和能登录该账号的人都能读取。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup files are not encrypted and contain all health information. In a cloud-drive sync folder, the cloud provider and anyone who can sign in to that account can read them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份文件夹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份文件夹当前不可用，请连接磁盘或恢复网络文件夹后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The backup folder is not available. Connect the disk or reconnect the network folder, then try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份文件夹所在磁盘没有足够空间。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The disk with the backup folder does not have enough space."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份文件验证未通过，没有保存不完整的备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The backup file did not pass verification. No incomplete backup was saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份时间": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backed up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份期间资料库发生了变化，续页会稍后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The library changed during the backup. Kinlogue will try again shortly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导出后的文件由你保管，续页不会再管理或删除它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The exported file is yours to keep. Kinlogue will not manage or delete it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导出备份": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export Backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导出备份到…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export Backup To…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导出期间资料库发生了变化或有原件未通过校验，导出未完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The library changed during the export, or an original failed its check. The export did not finish."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚未选择备份文件夹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No backup folder is selected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已验证的备份概要": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verified Backup Summary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前资料库不会因验证失败而被替换。你可以取消后重新选择备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A failed verification never replaces the current library. You can cancel and choose another backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所选文件不是续页备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The selected file is not a Kinlogue backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机待整理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From Phone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把同样的备份压缩包保存到任意位置。它不计入保留数量，续页之后也不会管理它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save the same backup ZIP anywhere. It does not count toward the backups to keep, and Kinlogue will not manage it afterwards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "数据备份与导出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup & Export"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整份备份含有全家所有人的资料，不要直接交给医生；可以只发送某位成员的文件夹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A backup holds every family member’s information. Do not give the whole backup to a doctor; send only that member’s folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文件夹当前不可用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folder not available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新备份已保存，但有较早的备份暂时没能检查或删除，续页会在下次备份时再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The new backup was saved, but some older backups could not be checked or deleted yet. Kinlogue will try again at the next backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法读取所选文件，请确认它已完整下载到这台 Mac 后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The selected file could not be read. Make sure it has fully downloaded to this Mac, then try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更改文件夹…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change Folder…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最近一次备份": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机写入并管理的备份": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backups managed by this Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在写入备份…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writing Backup…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在创建备份…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Creating backup…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在验证备份…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifying backup…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "续页把完整资料库写成 ZIP 压缩包，保存在你选择的文件夹里。文件夹可以在外置盘、NAS 上，也可以由阿里云盘、百度网盘等客户端同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kinlogue writes the whole library as a ZIP file into the folder you choose. The folder can be on an external disk or a NAS, or synced by a client such as Aliyun Drive or Baidu Netdisk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "续页运行时，资料变化后自动备份，每天最多一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While Kinlogue is open, it backs up after the library changes, at most once a day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "续页需要你重新选择备份文件夹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kinlogue needs you to choose the backup folder again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动备份默认关闭。选择文件夹后可以立即备份，或打开自动备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic backup is off by default. After choosing a folder, you can back up now or turn on automatic backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说明.txt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "README.txt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资料大小": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data size"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资料库的部分内容无法读取，备份未完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Part of the library could not be read. The backup did not finish."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资料库的部分内容无法读取，导出未完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Part of the library could not be read. The export did not finish."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资料库超出了单个备份能容纳的大小。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The library is larger than one backup can hold."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "超出份数时，续页只删除自己写入、之后没有被改名、移动或修改的备份；文件夹里的其他文件不会被删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beyond that number, Kinlogue deletes only backups it wrote that have not been renamed, moved or changed since. Nothing else in the folder is deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这份备份需要更新版本的续页。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This backup needs a newer version of Kinlogue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会替换而不是合并当前资料库。备份文件夹设置会保留，但自动备份会关闭，需要时请重新打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This replaces the current library instead of merging into it. The backup folder is kept, but automatic backup is turned off; turn it on again when you want it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择一个续页备份压缩包（.zip）。续页会先完整验证，确认之前不会修改当前资料库。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a Kinlogue backup ZIP. Kinlogue verifies it completely first and does not change the current library before you confirm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择一个续页备份压缩包，完整验证后替换当前资料库。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a Kinlogue backup ZIP, verify it completely and replace the current library with it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择备份文件…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Backup File…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择备份文件夹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Backup Folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择备份文件夹…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Backup Folder…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已创建 %@，并完整验证。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Created %@ and verified it completely."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "包含 %lld 个原件，压缩包 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%1$lld original, ZIP %2$@"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%1$lld originals, ZIP %2$@"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "续页备份 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kinlogue Backup %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "续页备份\n\n这个压缩包是续页资料库的完整备份，没有加密。任何拿到它的人都能看到其中全部家庭成员、报告、识别文字和原始文件。\n\nfiles 文件夹按家庭成员和日期存放原始文件，可以直接打开、打印，或把某位成员的文件夹发给医生。名称以“_%@”“_%@”“_%@”开头的文件夹里是尚未整理的原件。\n\nkinlogue-backup.json 和 data 文件夹用于恢复，请不要修改。恢复时在续页的“设置 → 数据备份与导出”中选择“从备份恢复…”，再选中这个压缩包；恢复会替换当前资料库。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kinlogue Backup\n\nThis ZIP file is a complete backup of a Kinlogue library and is not encrypted. Anyone who has it can see every family member, report, recognized text and original file in it.\n\nThe files folder holds the original files by family member and date. You can open or print them directly, or send one member’s folder to a doctor. Folders whose names start with “_%1$@”, “_%2$@” or “_%3$@” hold originals that are not organized yet.\n\nkinlogue-backup.json and the data folder are used for restoring; do not change them. To restore, choose “Restore from Backup…” in Kinlogue under Settings → Backup & Export and select this ZIP file. Restoring replaces the current library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "续页只在这台 Mac 上处理资料。默认保存在本机；只有在你选择备份文件夹或导出备份时，续页才会把未加密的备份压缩包写到你选择的位置，该位置是否被网盘客户端上传由对应客户端决定。只有在你主动开启“手机上传”时，才会临时接收同一局域网内浏览器发送的资料。资料库和备份都不提供应用层加密：报告和医学影像原件、成员资料及 OCR 结果以可读取的文件保存。能够访问此 Mac 用户资料或备份文件的人员或软件，以及包含资料库的 Time Machine 备份、APFS 快照或其他副本，可能读取这些内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kinlogue processes data only on this Mac. It stays local by default; only when you choose a backup folder or export a backup does Kinlogue write an unencrypted backup ZIP to the place you choose, and whether a cloud-drive client uploads that place is controlled by that client. Only when you start Phone Upload does Kinlogue temporarily receive files from a browser on the same local network. Neither the library nor its backups have application-level encryption: report and medical-image originals, member information, and OCR results are stored as readable files. People or software that can access this Mac user’s files or the backup files, and Time Machine backups, APFS snapshots, or other copies containing the library, may read this content."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
